<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">

  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Our Little Memory ♡</title>

  <meta
    name="description"
    content="我們的 PHOTOISM 拍貼回憶"
  >

  <style>
    /* =========================
       基本設定
    ========================= */

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;

      font-family:
        -apple-system,
        BlinkMacSystemFont,
        "Noto Sans TC",
        "PingFang TC",
        "Microsoft JhengHei",
        sans-serif;

      color: #4d4a4a;

      background:
        radial-gradient(
          circle at 10% 10%,
          rgba(255, 214, 224, 0.75),
          transparent 25%
        ),
        radial-gradient(
          circle at 90% 20%,
          rgba(255, 239, 193, 0.8),
          transparent 25%
        ),
        linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          #fffaf7 0%,
          #fff5f7 48%,
          #f9f5ff 100%
        );

      overflow-x: hidden;
    }


    /* =========================
       浮動裝飾
    ========================= */

    .floating {
      position: fixed;

      pointer-events: none;

      z-index: 0;

      opacity: 0.65;

      animation: float 7s ease-in-out infinite;

      user-select: none;
    }

    .heart1 {
      top: 9%;
      left: 7%;
      font-size: 34px;
      animation-delay: -1s;
    }

    .heart2 {
      top: 22%;
      right: 8%;
      font-size: 25px;
      animation-delay: -3s;
    }

    .heart3 {
      bottom: 13%;
      left: 5%;
      font-size: 26px;
      animation-delay: -5s;
    }

    .cookie {
      bottom: 7%;
      right: 6%;
      font-size: 38px;
      animation-delay: -2s;
    }


    @keyframes float {
      0%,
      100% {
        transform: translateY(0) rotate(-4deg);
      }

      50% {
        transform: translateY(-13px) rotate(5deg);
      }
    }


    /* =========================
       首頁標題
    ========================= */

    .hero {
      position: relative;

      z-index: 1;

      text-align: center;

      padding: 72px 20px 28px;
    }


    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;

      padding: 7px 15px;

      border-radius: 999px;

      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);

      border: 1px solid rgba(226, 176, 190, 0.35);

      color: #c98298;

      font-size: 13px;

      letter-spacing: 3px;

      box-shadow:
        0 8px 25px rgba(180, 130, 150, 0.08);
    }


    h1 {
      margin: 18px 0 8px;

      font-family:
        Georgia,
        "Times New Roman",
        serif;

      font-size: clamp(38px, 8vw, 72px);

      letter-spacing: 2px;

      color: #554b4d;

      line-height: 1.05;
    }


    .subtitle {
      margin: 0 auto;

      max-width: 620px;

      color: #8b7e82;

      font-size: 15px;

      line-height: 1.9;
    }


    /* =========================
       照片區
    ========================= */

    .photo-card {
      position: relative;

      z-index: 1;

      width: min(88vw, 650px);

      margin: 34px auto 24px;

      padding: 12px;

      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);

      border-radius: 20px;

      box-shadow:
        0 30px 70px rgba(112, 77, 91, 0.18),
        0 4px 12px rgba(112, 77, 91, 0.08);

      transform: rotate(-1deg);

      transition:
        transform 0.35s ease,
        box-shadow 0.35s ease;
    }


    .photo-card:hover {
      transform:
        rotate(0deg)
        translateY(-5px);

      box-shadow:
        0 35px 80px rgba(112, 77, 91, 0.22);
    }


    .photo-card img {
      display: block;

      width: 100%;

      height: auto;

      border-radius: 12px;
    }


    /* =========================
       照片說明
    ========================= */

    .caption {
      position: relative;

      z-index: 1;

      width: min(88vw, 650px);

      margin: 0 auto;

      text-align: center;
    }


    .caption p {
      margin: 12px 0;

      font-size: 16px;

      color: #6f6568;
    }


    .dots {
      margin-top: 18px;

      color: #d993a8;

      letter-spacing: 8px;

      font-size: 14px;
    }


    /* =========================
       回憶文字卡片
    ========================= */

    .memory {
      position: relative;

      z-index: 1;

      width: min(90vw, 760px);

      margin: 64px auto 70px;

      padding: 32px 28px;

      border-radius: 24px;

      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.56);

      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);

      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);

      text-align: center;
    }


    .memory h2 {
      margin: 0 0 14px;

      font-size: 22px;

      font-weight: 600;

      color: #62565a;
    }


    .memory p {
      margin: 0;

      line-height: 2;

      color: #817579;

      font-size: 15px;
    }


    /* =========================
       Footer
    ========================= */

    footer {
      position: relative;

      z-index: 1;

      padding: 22px;

      text-align: center;

      color: #ad969e;

      font-size: 12px;

      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }


    /* =========================
       手機版
    ========================= */

    @media (max-width: 600px) {

      .hero {
        padding-top: 48px;
      }

      .photo-card {
        width: 92vw;
      }

      .memory {
        width: 90vw;

        padding: 26px 20px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 42px;
      }

      .subtitle {
        font-size: 14px;
      }
    }

  </style>
</head>


<body>


  <!-- =========================
       浮動小裝飾
  ========================= -->

  <div class="floating heart1">♡</div>

  <div class="floating heart2">♡</div>

  <div class="floating heart3">♡</div>

  <div class="floating cookie">🍪</div>



  <!-- =========================
       Header
  ========================= -->

  <header class="hero">

    <span class="eyebrow">
      TAKE A PHOTOISM
    </span>

    <h1>
      Our Little Memory
    </h1>

    <p class="subtitle">

      把那一天的笑臉，偷偷收藏起來。<br>

      一張照片，四個人，一段不會重播的青春。

    </p>

  </header>



  <!-- =========================
       Main
  ========================= -->

  <main>


    <!-- PHOTOISM 照片 -->

    <div class="photo-card">

      <img
        src="IMG_6593.jpg"
        alt="我們的 PHOTOISM 拍貼照片"
      >

    </div>



    <!-- 照片說明 -->

    <div class="caption">

      <p>
        📸 PHOTOISM · 四人限定回憶
      </p>

      <div class="dots">
        ♡ · ♡ · ♡
      </div>

    </div>



    <!-- 回憶文字 -->

    <section class="memory">

      <h2>
        今天也要好好記住
      </h2>

      <p>

        有些日子其實很普通，<br>

        但和喜歡的人一起，<br>

        就會變成值得保存很久的照片。

      </p>

    </section>


  </main>



  <!-- =========================
       Footer
  ========================= -->

  <footer>

    Made with ♡ · 2026

  </footer>


</body>
</html>
